  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan refines it in Shang clan city while news of the three kings inheritance draws Gu Masters to San Cha mountain. The recipe needs two seven fragrances liquor worm and eyeballs of nine different hundred beast kings. Three days after the final fusion, he obtains the worm and stores it in his aperture.",
        "chapters": [
          326
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "loc_shang_clan_city",
          "fac_gu_masters",
          "loc_san_cha_mountain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "At the time of refinement Fang Yuan is still rank three peak stage and cannot use it until rank four.",
        "chapters": [
          326
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "purifying-primeval-essence",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Once he is rank four initial stage with light gold primeval essence, the worm raises that essence by a small realm into bright golden primeval essence.",
        "chapters": [
          344
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "purifying-primeval-essence",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "While using essence iron bone Gu and ancient bronze skin Gu, he also uses nine eyes liquor worm to refine initial stage light gold primeval essence into bright gold primeval essence, then uses that essence to cleanse his aperture.",
        "chapters": [
          355
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "essence-raised-through-rank-four",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_essence_iron_bone_gu",
          "gu_ancient_bronze_skin_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "On reaching rank four middle stage, using nine eyes liquor worm would give him rank four upper stage essence gold primeval essence.",
        "chapters": [
          358
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "essence-raised-through-rank-four",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "At rank four middle stage with bright golden primeval essence, nine eyes liquor worm purifies that essence into essence gold primeval essence. Fang Yuan pours that essence into Bai Ning Bing’s aperture through bone flesh unity Gu to nourish and strengthen her aperture.",
        "chapters": [
          365
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "essence-raised-through-rank-four",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_bai_ning_bing",
          "gu_bone_flesh_unity_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
